From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 12:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 106/106] PC5: the loading screen shows how far the start is (Wine
 patch 0908)

Its bar filled on a timer, whatever the game was doing. Wine now counts
the images it mapped when the game's program was and the windows the
display driver showed; the loading screen fills through Windows starting,
the program and its DLLs loading and its window, then the game's own
loading over the time it took last time. PC5 shows the same picture as it
hands the game over, so the screen comes back at once, without a wait.
---
